OL,3,GNEWSAMissing sculpture returned with an
OL,4,Aapology and #100 charity donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sculpture which disappeared from an
OL,7,Fart exhibition in a suspected theft has
OL,8,Fbeen returned with an apology and #100
OL,9,Fdonation to a charity.
OL,11,FPolice were called after the scrap
OL,12,Fmetal bird made by artist Helen
OL,13,FDenerley vanished from Eden Court
OL,14,FTheatre in Inverness last month.
OL,16,FIt was due to be sold following the
OL,17,Fexhibition for the Scottish Mental
OL,18,FHealth Arts Festival to help raise
OL,19,Fmoney for Centred.
